{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1341848-contagion-storytelling-advices","id":1341848,"title":"Contagion Storytelling Advices","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-17T06:58:43-07:00","id":1341848,"title":"Contagion Storytelling Advices","content":"Could not find proper topic for those kind questions - so I started one. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Here is my, opening problem -<br /> <br /> <b>If I make PC infected with Contagion, should I say to player that his character has new Condition <i>Contagion Carrier </i>or <i>Contagion-Touched</i>? </b>Or just to let it be a secret for some time?<br /> <br /> The PC is does not know she is sick until some symptoms show up, does it? What do you think about it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-17-2019, 10:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T04:46:34-07:00","id":1342690,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry, you're making a PC for someone else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T11:11:56-07:00","id":1342754,"title":"","content":"No, I run as ST <b>Werewolf</b> game that is becoming more <b>Werewolf</b>-<b>Contagion</b> game - as backdrop of our <b>Werewolf</b> game was already about fighting supernatural disease. It's just now it's have nice mechanics of this 'supernatural disease' is the Contagion. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> The player in question just do not know his PC is gotten infected - yet.<br /> <br /> ... or rather was in moment of post writing. Now he, as Viking Uratha, was trying to drink alter wine in church - and got sudden <i>Wasu-Im</i>, as he was having previous Trigger 'Human Blood'. For this PC that was earlier infected with Contagion, alter wine become real 'Blood of Christ' - and lead to <i>Kuruth</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-21T11:34:31-07:00","id":1342762,"title":"","content":"I've no idea what you're asking about, or what you're saying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-25T19:36:48-07:00","id":1343704,"title":"","content":"He's asking whether players should know if they get Contagion conditions. I'd say... maybe? I'd make there be some way to tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T03:48:23-07:00","id":1343742,"title":"","content":"Yeah, should PCs know if they are Contagion Touched. I alluded by two sessions to Uratha player by making him susceptible to Kuruth Triggers that he should not have - but the full revelation was then PC could not see his reflection in the water! ( It's Stage 1 of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\">my Iconoclasm Contagion</a>. ) De facto, by end of second session, I moved PC from Contagion Touched to Infected 1 Condition.<br /> <br /> BTW, to see how Contagion is spreading on PCs and NPCs I use <b><i>Stamina + Resolve - &lt;number of days of interaction &gt;</i></b> roll from <b>Night Horrors: Shunned By The Moon</b>, Geryo chapter. It get's <i>nice </i>results - one PC infected by sick Totem of enemy Pack in their confrontation, now after two session infected by PCs pack friendly NPC. And Contagion is starting to spread... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T06:23:54-07:00","id":1343757,"title":"","content":"Ok, if you're handling out conditions, you have to give them to the player.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T06:47:44-07:00","id":1343759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1341848-contagion-storytelling-advices?p=1343757#post1343757\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, if you're handling out conditions, you have to give them to the player.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why, really? Some effect of Conditions can be hidden by the story and/or narration. Like <i>Swooned </i>for a scene - ST just described you like really attracted to particular NPC. Or <i>Deprived</i> can be described by ST by great hunger for things. You do not need granting direct Conditions on first session ( maybe? ) of the Condition life for the character. Where status become much more permanent, it surely should be shown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T07:02:48-07:00","id":1343761,"title":"","content":"As somebody who has given a custom Condition to a player before they knew entirely what it meant: You still ought to give them at least a partially obscured version of the Condition card so they know what the thing is incentivizing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-27T19:16:06-07:00","id":1344113,"title":"","content":"Like Satchel said: if I don't have the text of the condition, I dunno how to act on it. You can narrate whatever the eff you want, if you don't gimme the condition, I'm not gonna act on your descriptions of what is <b>my</b> character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}